    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nFallback pynvim version lookup is broken since Vimscript-to-Lua rewrite.\r\n- `vim.fs.basename()` returns the module filename instead of the directory needed to discover adjacent metadata. This produces an empty metadata list, hiding the remaining issues.\r\n- `table.sort()` requires a Boolean comparator, while `vim.version.cmp()` returns a number.\r\n- `table.sort()` sorts in place and returns no value, so assigning its result discards the metadata list.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n- Use `vim.fs.dirname()` to discover adjacent package metadata.\r\n- Use `vim.version.gt()` as the descending Boolean comparator.\r\n- Sort the metadata list in place. This restores fallback version detection when `neovim.VERSION` is unavailable.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-02T12:12:08Z",
